# watchtower
===
 Turn a computer you already own into your personal cloud. Deploy your website from GitHub — database, backups, private URL over Tailscale — for $0/month. When a deploy breaks, it fixes itself. Self-hosted Vercel/Coolify alternative on rootless Podman.
